== About
I was a {{<del>final year</del>}} Ph.D. student at IIT Hyderabad, advised by [https://www.iith.ac.in/~vineethnb/ Prof. Vineeth N Balasubramanian], and have defended my thesis in the [https://cse.iith.ac.in/ Department of Computer Science and Engineering] at [https://iith.ac.in/ IIT Hyderabad (IITH)]. I have begun my new role as Senior Researcher at Fujitsu Research India. My research focuses on trustworthy machine learning, multimodal reasoning, and self-evolving agents. I am currently exploring memory for self-evolving agents.
You can find my CV [https://drive.google.com/file/d/11UpQAkVPRXWE53MF4PoJ0ijL4WnJ4hby/view?usp=sharing here].

== Research Interests
- Self-evolving agents and memory
- Visual reasoning in Multimodal LLMs (spatial reasoning, grounding, RLVR/RL post-training)
- Human-in-the-loop \/ preference-aware learning (algorithmic recourse)
- Robustness, interpretability, and reliability of ML systems

